odot. Frame synthesis is OpenXRs core API for advanced reprojection (e.g. Space Warp). When enabled, provided its supported by the XR runtime, a lower resolution motion vector buffer and depth buffer is rendered and provided to the XR runtime. The XR runtime can now inject reprojection frames and compensate for lower framerates.\r\n\r\nCurrent limitations:\r\n- Does not work on the Forward+ renderer\r\n- Requires #97151 for Compatibility\r\n- Only works with stereo rendering\r\n\r\n> [!NOTE]\r\n> There is an outstanding question about Vulkan NDC however testing on PICO hardware this is working as expected.\r\n> We'll do an additional PR if there turns out to be an issue on other hardware once they support this extension.\r\n\r\n*Contributed by Khronos Group through the Godot Integration Project*","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":865585000,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4NjU1ODUwMDA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:xr","name":"topic:xr","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other